n-reader semantics beyond what the keyboard\nfixes require, and flows outside the four audited ones.\n\n## Acceptance Criteria\n\n- Each of the four audited flows can be completed end-to-end using keyboard\n  alone, verified by a manual keyboard-only walkthrough of each flow.\n- No focus traps remain in the modals of the audited flows; focus behavior on\n  modal open and close is correct in each affected modal.\n- Every control in the audited flows is reachable and operable by keyboard —\n  the audit's \"unreachable controls\" findings are all remediated.\n- Focus indicators are visible and consistent across all controls in the\n  audited flows.\n- Every defect in the audit report's per-flow enumeration is fixed, or has an\n  explicitly recorded disposition (fixed / waived with rationale) — no\n  silently dropped findings.\n- Existing Dashboard CI and tests pass with the changes.\n\n## HLR Traceability\n\n- **HLR-1 (P1)**: The four audited core flows are fully operable by keyboard,\n  with no focus traps or unreachable controls — this epic's primary scope.\n- **HLR-2 (P1)**: Visible focus indicators are consistent across the audited\n  flows — bundled into this epic because the remediation is one sweep over the\n  same four flows' shared UI surfaces and the same audit defect list; a\n  separate epic would force a second pass over every flow.\n"}}],"model":"rits/zai-org/glm-5-3","stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":27107,"output_tokens":0},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":"chatcmpl-tool-9b587b8f3d33ea09","agent_id":"a8aa738f449e181ad","session_id":"ebedd0d9-b226-4e93-9723-2e0aa7ef8109","uuid":"c2c4eafe-a7bd-46d9-8fc1-78d4b9df56cd","timestamp":"2026-10-26T16:23:20.871Z","subagent_type":"claude","task_description":"Decompose RHAISTRAT-9017 into epics"}
